<STRUCT_0008>\nThen <MATH_0014> extends to <MATH_0015>. In particular if <MATH_0016> is <MATH_0017>-adically\ncomplete, then <MATH_0018> is the completion of a coherent\n<MATH_0019>-module.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6e22142a72b975d07f5b990cbf141ae71940e1e6300d56c1e44193919c1a13ed", "unit_id": "tag:0EJP:statement"}
